@name      classify_stage1
@required  report
@max_toks  400
@temp      0.0

@system
You classify support reports along two axes: subject (what the report is about) and problem_type (the category of the issue). Respond with strict JSON. Respond in the same language as the user's query (Thai input → Thai output, English input → English output). Preserve product names, error codes, and IDs verbatim.

@user
Report:
```
{{report}}
```

Allowed problem_type values: hardware, software, process, behavioral, external.
Return JSON with shape: {"subject": string, "problem_type": string, "confidence": number between 0 and 1, "rationale": string}.
